| 25 March 717 – 18 June 741<br/>{{Small|({{Age in years, months and days|717|3|25|741|6|18}})}}
| Born {{Circa|685}} in [[Kahramanmaraş|Germanikeia]], [[Commagene]], he became a general. Rose in rebellion and secured the throne in spring 717. Repelled the [[Second Arab Siege of Constantinople]] and initiated the [[Byzantine Iconoclasm]].

